    "description": "Set within a charming warehouse conversion, formerly a historic button factory, this fantastic one bedroom apartment offers a unique blend of character, space and modern living in the heart of Walthamstow Central. The property benefits from a bright and spacious reception room with plenty of natural light, creating an ideal living and entertaining space for tenants. The modern fitted kitchen offers ample storage and worktop space, whilst the well-proportioned double bedroom provides comfortable accommodation. Completing the property is a contemporary bathroom finished to a good standard. Ideally positioned for renters seeking both convenience and lifestyle, the apartment is just moments from Walthamstow Central Station, providing excellent transport links via the Victoria Line and London Overground with direct access into Central London, Oxford Circus, King’s Cross and Liverpool Street. Numerous bus routes are also nearby, making commuting simple and efficient. The property is surrounded by a wide range of local amenities including the famous Walthamstow Market, Europe’s longest outdoor market, alongside an excellent selection of independent cafés, restaurants, bars and shops. Nearby shopping options also include The Mall Walthamstow, local supermarkets and a variety of fitness facilities including PureGym and The Gym Group. For tenants who enjoy outdoor space and a more active lifestyle, the apartment is ideally located close to several well-known green spaces. Lloyd Park, located approximately 0.8 miles away, offers landscaped gardens, tennis courts, an outdoor gym and the popular William Morris Gallery. Walthamstow Wetlands, one of Europe’s largest urban wetland reserves, is also within easy reach and provides beautiful walking and cycling routes, wildlife areas and waterside scenery. Additionally, the open green spaces of Hollow Ponds and Epping Forest are nearby, perfect for weekend walks, running routes and outdoor activities. This property would make an excellent home for professional tenants or couples looking for a stylish and well-connected apartment in one of East London’s most vibrant and sought-after rental locations. A licence restricts number of tenants to a maximum of 2 unrelated persons or a family EPC Rating: D. Council Tax Band: B. Rent excludes utilities, the tenancy deposit and any other permitted payments. Monthly rent is £1,500.00 PCM Deposit payable is £1,730.76 based on the advertised rent A Holding Deposit of £346.15, based on the advertised rent, is required to reserve this property. Min Term 1 year fixed term. Broadband type availability & speed: / Mobile coverage checker: Parking permit availability from local authority: / Additional parking info: Please note this is a car free development and therefore on street or off-street parking permits are not available. Please contact us for further information or visit our website Read full description COUNCIL TAX Band: B PARKING Yes GARDEN Yes ACCESSIBILITY Ask agent Energy performance certificate - ask agent Utilities, rights & restrictions Erskine Road, London, E17 Approximate location Open map Street View My places Stations Schools Add an important place to see how long it'd take to get there from our property listings. __mins driving to your place Broadband speed About Portico, Walthamstow 163-165 Hoe Street, London, E17 3AL Industry affiliations: Portico have been helping match the people of London with their perfect property since 1818 when we began life as Edmund Cude. Under family ownership for two centuries, Portico was acquired by the Leaders Romans Group in 2021. Combining our expert knowledge of the London property market and maintaining our founding principles of integrity, approachability, and reliability we coupled access to the suite of LRG brands and products extending our service offering. To our core service offering of buying, selling, letting and renting we added expertise in mortgages and insurance, buy to let, shared ownership, conveyancing and surveyors amongst others. Read more View our properties to rent Find out more about us Notes These notes are private, only you can see them. Save note MARKETED BY Portico, Walthamstow 163-165 Hoe Street, London, E17 3AL More properties from this agent Call agent",
